OL,3,GNEWSACouncil urged to drop tax for
OL,4,Aterminally ill
OL,5,
OL,6,FA local authority is being urged to
OL,7,Fconsider exempting terminally ill
OL,8,Fpeople from paying council tax.
OL,10,FCumberland Council is being asked to
OL,11,Freview and adopt the measure for
OL,12,Fresidents with an SR1 medical report in
OL,13,Fthe 2027/28 financial year.
OL,15,FThe question, from Labour councillor
OL,16,FJeanette Whalen, is set for
OL,17,Fconsideration at the council meeting on
OL,18,FTuesday, 8 September.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
